<header class="page-hero">
  <h1>Choose the right hardware for you</h1>
  <p class="page-hero-subtitle">Buy the hardware from the seller of your choice. The skyBlip software and its updates are free, with no subscription.</p>
  <p>To <%= link_to_page "install", label: "install skyBlip" %>, you&rsquo;ll need a computer with Chrome or Edge and a USB-C data cable.</p>
</header>

<section id="choose" class="band band--tint">
  <h2 class="section-title">Go, Go+, Bravo or Tango?</h2>
  <p>Go transmits your position in ADS-L and shows ADS-L and FLARM traffic. Bravo detects Mode S and ADS-B transponders.</p>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table class="compare">
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">If you want to</th><th scope="col">Choose</th><th scope="col">Hardware to order</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">See ADS-L and FLARM traffic on a pocket radar and transmit your position in ADS-L.</th><td><%= link_to_page "features", label: "Go" %></td><td>LilyGO T-Echo</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Keep the same radar and add sound and vibration to the on-screen alert.</th><td><%= link_to_page "features", label: "Go+" %></td><td>LilyGO T-Echo Plus</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">See ADS-B traffic in a compatible navigation app.</th><td><%= link_to_page "skyblip-bravo", label: "Bravo" %></td><td>MeshTracker X1</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Add ADS-B traffic to the radar on Go or Go+.</th><td><%= link_to_page "skyblip-tango", label: "Tango" %></td><td>A T-Echo or T-Echo Plus and a MeshTracker X1, bought separately</td></tr>
      </tbody>
      <tfoot>
        <tr><td colspan="3">Go shows gliders equipped with FLARM, but it doesn&rsquo;t transmit FLARM or replace your FLARM.</td></tr>
      </tfoot>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p><strong>For Go and Go+, check that the listing says 868 MHz and BME280 barometer.</strong> Some variants aren&rsquo;t suitable for skyBlip. The Go needs the BME280 barometer.</p>
  <div class="photo-row">
    <%= content_image_tag "pages/index/skyblip-go-techo.avif", alt: "LilyGO T-Echo" %>
    <%= content_image_tag "pages/buy/skyblip-go-plus.avif", alt: "LilyGO T-Echo Plus", class: "photo-go-plus" %>
    <%= content_image_tag "pages/skyblip-bravo/seeed-x1.avif", alt: "Seeed SenseCAP MeshTracker X1", class: "photo-x1" %>
  </div>
</section>

