<section id="install" class="band">
  <h2 class="section-title">Already have the hardware?</h2>
  <p>Use a computer with Chrome or Edge and a USB-C data cable. Briefing installs the skyBlip software on your device. Then connect over Bluetooth from that computer or an Android phone with Chrome. You don&rsquo;t need to open the device or solder anything.</p>
  <p id="install-bravo" class="signature"><%= link_to_page "install", label: "See how to install skyBlip", class: "button button--primary" %></p>
  <p id="type" class="signature"><%= link_to_page "go-first-steps", label: "Choose your aircraft type", anchor: "type" %> · <%= link_to_page "mount", label: "Mount it in the cockpit" %></p>
</section>
